the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and the thing location the second thing with red at the time
    and the thing redmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing is the cellempty of the fourth thing at the time.

the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the thing location the second thing with black at the time
    and the thing blackmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing is the cellempty of the fourth thing at the time.

the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is legal at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and the thing location the second thing with red at the time
    and the thing redjump the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with black at the time
    and the fifth thing is the cellempty of the sixth thing at the time.

the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the thing location the second thing with black at the time
    and the thing blackjump the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with red at the time
    and the fifth thing is the cellempty of the sixth thing at the time.

the goal of a role is a number at a time if
    the role is the capturecount of a count at the time
    and the scoremap of the count is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a role is a role
    and it is not the case that the role is a haspiece at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    41 is a step at the time.

a role is a haspiece at a time if
    a thing location a second thing with the role at the time.

a thing is the cellempty of a second thing at a time if
    the thing is the iscell of the second thing
    and it is not the case that the thing location the second thing with black at the time
    and it is not the case that the thing location the second thing with red at the time.

when the move capture is made
    and a role is a control
    and the role is the capturecount of a count
    and the count countplus a thing
then the role is the capturecount of the thing
    and it is not the case that the role is the capturecount of the count.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with a second role
then the fifth thing location the sixth thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the third thing location the fourth thing with the second role
    and it is not the case that the thing location the second thing with the role.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and a role is a control
    and the role is the capturecount of a count
    and the count countplus a seventh thing
    and the thing location the second thing with a second role
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with a third role
then the role is the capturecount of the seventh thing
    and it is not the case that the role is the capturecount of the count.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and a seventh thing is a step
    and the pp of the seventh thing is a eighth thing
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with a second role
then the eighth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the seventh thing is a step.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and red is a control
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with a second role
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and black is a control
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
    and the third thing location the fourth thing with a second role
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
then the third thing location the fourth thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the thing location the second thing with the role.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and a fifth thing is a step
    and the pp of the fifth thing is a sixth thing
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
then the sixth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the fifth thing is a step.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and red is a control
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and black is a control
    and the thing location the second thing with a role
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

when the move noop is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the pp of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move noop is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move noop is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move jump with the thing, the second thing, the third thing, the fourth thing, the fifth thing and the sixth thing is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the thing, the second thing, the third thing and the fourth thing is legal.

